SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: BAMMY Fridays
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. \nFrom smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nBAMMY Fridays is a live band and DJ experience that brings together musicians\, selectors\, and Caribbean sound system culture. The series delivers a community-rooted night centered on rhythm\, dance\, and the music that shaped generations.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-sessions-bammy-fridays/
