DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. \nEase into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nIt’s a party! This family-friendly DJ dance event is the perfect afternoon activity for kids\, by kids. Catch emerging young DJ talent live on the TD Stage at Union Summer. \nThis program is in partnership with the Toronto DJ Academy.
