SUMMARY:Rudy Ray Show: Ethio Armenia – Jazz Night
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Jazz Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds—it’s an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nEthio Armenia – Jazz Night presents a storytelling-driven concept blending Ethiopian jazz with Armenian musical traditions\, inspired by the historical narrative of Armenian orphans adopted by Haile Selassie. The performance explores cultural connection through sound\, weaving together distinct musical lineages into a reflective and expressive live experience. \nThis program is in partnership with Rudy Ray.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/rudy-ray-show-ethio-armenia-jazz-night/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
