DESCRIPTION:Visit Coldstream Clear brand at the York Kiosk for samples of Chilly Pop Wild White vodka cooler. \nColdstream Clear is popping up at Union Station’s York Kiosk on July 13th\, handing out free full-size cans of Chilly Pop from 12:30 PM-7:00 PM (5% ABV. Vodka Beverage – Consume at home – ID required). \n19+ ID Required. \nSampling events are independently operated by third-party brands and agencies. The products being distributed\, sample sizes\, quantities\, giveaway limits\, eligibility requirements\, and event operations are determined solely by the participating brand and may change at the brand’s discretion without notice. \n  \nUnion Station does not control\, manage\, or guarantee the type\, size\, quantity\, quality\, or availability of samples provided. Union Station is not responsible for any changes to the products being distributed or the manner in which they are distributed. Any questions\, concerns\, or feedback regarding a sampling event should be directed to the participating brand. \n  \nSampling hours may vary and events may begin later than scheduled\, pause for breaks\, or conclude early once supplies have been exhausted. Guests are not permitted to queue or wait near the kiosk during non-operating periods. \n  \nWe ask all guests to treat staff\, brand representatives\, and fellow visitors with courtesy and respect. Disruptive\, aggressive\, or inappropriate behaviour may result in refusal of service and denial of participation in the sampling event.” 
