SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: Johannes Linstead
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with our premier sponsor TD\, Union Summer presents a diverse and dynamic lineup of artists in collaboration with TD-supported festivals. July and August programming features performers from TD-supported festivals\, highlighting world-class talent across genres. \nJohannes Linstead is an internationally recognized guitarist known for blending Latin\, jazz\, world\, and instrumental music. With hundreds of millions of streams and multiple awards\, including “Guitarist of the Year\,” he has established himself as one of the leading figures in contemporary instrumental music. \nIn partnership with the Beaches Jazz Festival\, his performance brings together global musical influences\, combining upbeat Latin rhythms with emotional ballads and rich instrumental arrangements featuring diverse international musicians.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/td-music-tuesdays-johannes-linstead/
