SUMMARY:Spotlight on Women: Union Summer
DESCRIPTION:Explore a lineup of women in music with a roster of Toronto’s top female talent. \nSpotlight on Women celebrates the creativity\, artistry\, and impact of female musicians\, bringing exceptional live performances to the Union Summer stage. From emerging voices to established artists\, this series showcases the diverse talent shaping Toronto’s music scene. \nThis program is in partnership with City Hall Live\, a City of Toronto program that creates paid opportunities for local bands and provides accessible live music experiences for residents and visitors. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot.
