SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: Soul Nostalgic
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. \nFrom smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nSoul Nostalgic is an R&B and soul Vegas-style throwback experience led by JUNO Award winner Dru Grange. The show blends classic soul influences with modern performance energy\, creating a high-impact live set designed for audience engagement and nostalgia-driven celebration.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/soul-sessions-soul-nostalgic/
