SUMMARY:Day Parties: OTW @ Union Summer
DESCRIPTION:Make Union Summer your first Saturday night stop. Our Day Parties kick things off with a dynamic rotation of live music\, themed weekly to set just the right vibe. From DJ-led dance parties to feel-good live sets\, it’s all about great music\, refreshing drinks\, and a lively crowd ready to move. Start your night where the energy’s already high. \nOTW (Of The World) transforms Union Station into a high-energy celebration of global music\, dance\, and culture inspired by the spirit of international football and the electric match-day atmosphere taking over Toronto this summer. As part of Union Summer Presented by TD\, the experience brings together internationally inspired sounds\, live performances\, DJs\, dancers\, and immersive crowd energy in the heart of downtown Toronto. \nCurated by 4KORNERS\, internationally recognized DJ and Official DJ of the Toronto Raptors\, OTW reflects the energy of a city welcoming the world. Drawing inspiration from global football culture and the unifying power of music\, the event transforms Union Station into an open-air cultural celebration where rhythm\, movement\, and community collide. \nBlending Afrobeats\, Dancehall\, Amapiano\, Baile Funk\, Hip-Hop\, Caribbean\, Latin\, and global club sounds\, the programming is designed to mirror the diversity and international spirit of both Toronto and OTW. Throughout the evening\, OTW dancers will perform live choreographed activations during 4KORNERS’ sets\, creating continuous movement\, crowd interaction\, and visual energy across the plaza.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/day-parties-otw-union-summer/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/union.jpg
GEO:43.6453166;-79.3804073
