SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Duck Society
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nDuck Society is a Toronto-based jazz fusion collective made up of some of the city’s most respected jazz musicians alongside emerging talent. Performing original compositions\, the group blends tight arrangements with space for improvisation\, creating a dynamic and evolving live experience. \nEach piece is designed as a musical journey\, balancing storytelling with rhythm and groove\, encouraging both attentive listening and movement.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/brunch-brass-duck-society/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
