SUMMARY:Rudy Ray Show: Tariq Henry
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Jazz Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds—it’s an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nTariq Henry brings a distinctive live jazz performance rooted in improvisation\, musical storytelling\, and contemporary expression. His set explores dynamic textures and evolving rhythms\, creating an intimate yet exploratory experience within the Rudy Ray series. \nThis program is in partnership with Rudy Ray.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/rudy-ray-show-tariq-henry/
